      "url": "https://gimetry.online/work/pocketpills",
      "description": "Gimetry Studio delivered a brand refresh, website redesign, and motion design system for Pocketpills — Canada's largest online pharmacy — at a pivotal inflection point: the integration of telehealth alongside its existing pharmacy platform. Working alongside SixZero (app UX), Gimetry Studio created a unified, credible, and intuitive digital experience anchored in trust, convenience, and innovation. The result is a scalable design system that positions Pocketpills as a comprehensive healthcare platform, balancing the rigour of healthcare with the clarity of a modern tech product.",
